---
title: Package release review
description: Review compatibility and verification evidence before a release decision.
schema:
  CompatibleChange:
    kind: "'compatible'"
    summary: string
  BreakingChange:
    kind: "'breaking'"
    summary: string
    migration: string
  Verification:
    name: string
    status: "'passed' | 'failed' | 'pending'"
    evidence: string
  Release:
    packageName: string
    version: string
    consumers: string[]
    changes: "(CompatibleChange | BreakingChange)[]"
    verification: Verification[]
    blockers: string[]
input: Release
---
# Release review: {packageName} {version}

This document records evidence for review. It does not authorize publication.

## Consumer impact

<$each items={consumers} as="consumer">
  - {consumer}
</$each>

## Changes

<$each items={changes} as="change">
  <$match value={change}>
    <$case type="CompatibleChange">
      ### Compatible change

      {change.summary}
    </$case>
    <$case type="BreakingChange">
      ### Breaking change

      {change.summary}

      **Required migration:** {change.migration}
    </$case>
  </$match>
</$each>

## Verification evidence

<$each items={verification} as="check">
  ### {check.name} — {check.status}

  {check.evidence}

  <$show if={check.status !== "passed"}>
    This check does not establish release readiness.
  </$show>
</$each>

<$show if={blockers.length > 0}>
  ## Unresolved blockers

  <$each items={blockers} as="blocker">
    - {blocker}
  </$each>
</$show>

<$show if={blockers.length === 0}>
  No blockers were supplied. Review the verification evidence before making a
  release decision; an empty blocker list is not proof of readiness.
</$show>
